<title>JAPAN: Tokyu Construction - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tokyu Construction - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		158.01		vs	  174.70</p>
<p> Operating	    2.10		vs	    4.33</p>
<p> Current		1.28		vs	    1.78</p>
<p> Net		  349    mln	  vs	  454    mln</p>
<p> EPS		    1.50 yen	  vs	    1.97 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    233 million	  vs	 230 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tokyu Construction Co Ltd is a general contractor and member of the Tokyu group.</p>
</text>
